---
title: Homelab
# Background: keep the operator's photo but dim it hard so card text wins.
# blur removed + cardBlur lowered to xs => far cheaper backdrop-filter on ~30
# cards (the old blur:sm + cardBlur:md was the unreadable/sluggish render).
background:
  image: /images/background.jpg
  blur: none
  saturate: 50
  brightness: 35
  opacity: 55
theme: dark
color: slate
headerStyle: underlined
cardBlur: xs
# Graceful degradation + lighter UI: one unreachable widget no longer drags the
# whole board (hideErrors), and compact status dots instead of UP/DOWN text.
hideErrors: true
statusStyle: dot
layout:
  Media:
    style: row
    columns: 4
  Network:
    style: row
    columns: 4
  Infrastructure:
    style: row
    columns: 4
  Data:
    style: row
    columns: 2
  Observability:
    style: row
    columns: 4
  Exporters:
    style: row
    columns: 3
    initiallyCollapsed: true
